# Public-tree ignore list. Maintained in the PRIVATE repo at
# scripts/public-overlay/.gitignore and overlaid at export — never edit it
# in the public repo. Deliberately minimal: it must NOT name any internal
# path (docs/, tooling, editor state), so a reader learns nothing private.

# Dependencies & build outputs
node_modules/
src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/gen/
*.log
.DS_Store
